ready: 1
kind: entity_group
id: recall.data
module: recall
title: Recall data
summary: What recall keeps for itself; memories themselves belong to the memory module.
entities:
  - recall.data.checkpoint
  - recall.data.boot-config
  - recall.data.recall-log
  - recall.data.usage
  - recall.data.search-index
  - recall.data.index-state
rationale: >-
  Recall keeps only state about how memory is brought back. The usage counts
  outlive the recall log because ranking needs a memory's whole helped and hurt
  history, while the log itself holds session-level detail that expires. The
  search index is derived from memory.data.memory-change and can be rebuilt at
  any time.
